| safe-02 | HSTS + Expect-CT + CORS | CORS only |
| safe-00 | HSTS + Expect-CT + CORS | CORS only |

**Finding**: Credential-gated GET handler (`/backups/{id}` 400 response) returns `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` without `Strict-Transport-Security` or `Expect-CT` headers. The OPTIONS preflight handler includes both security headers. Same host, two distinct middleware paths.

**Severity**: LOW (network attacker can strip HSTS on error path; credential-gated surface limits blast radius)

**Next action**: This finding is passive-only and on the ACCEPTED list. Moving to formal report.
